Subject: [PATCH] WIP EastSun 1008 uncommitted (save only, do not integrate):
 HT9050 tray-cylinder direction edits in acatchtray.cpp / asendic_Loader.cpp
 and the HT9050 cylinder-enable block in cinitial.cpp.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pushed at the 03:00 hand-in (Jimmy 1008 22:2x: "EastSun 還沒做完、沒 commit 的改動也推，subject 開頭標 WIP（筆電只保存、不整合）").
Built on ce0c0f9, which is not moved: this commit is made with git commit-tree and is not on the branch. The files are as they stand in
EastSun's working tree at 03:0x:
- acatchtray.cpp: Empty LoaderZ_Select / MobileTrayTableSelect Push <-> Pop.
- asendic_Loader.cpp: TrayZ_Selector Push <-> Pop, + C_Load_Up.Push.
- cinitial.cpp: HT9050 disables the Color cylinders and C_Empty_Middle before the AUTO_EMPTY_COLOR branch; the W906_TrayZ9050
  declarations are split onto separate lines.
Left out on purpose: PadInterface_St02.cpp (the HT9050 rear-pad SafeLock line -- a safety bypass this session never commits or builds).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
